==Battleground==
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s (400%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (400%) spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 18~24.67 seconds<sup>540f~740f</sup>.
*Infinite [[White Wind]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Large Iron Ball]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Shadow Boxer Ks and the Otters are the main threat in this stage, as the Iron Balls serve as a nuisance to deter the use of single hit attacks, as they will absorb shots from [[Dragon Cat]]. Instead, [[Paris Cat]] is a far better option, being able to actually deal damage to the Shadow Boxer Ks, and [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is a great unit to use against the Otters, being able to one shot the traitless and send the Dark Otters into knockbackable territory. You're essentially just gonna have to grind out the Iron Balls unless you bring a critical hitter, but if the Otters and Shadow Boxers are dead, the stage is basically over.

